WEBVTT

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.340
Okay.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.420
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.220
Two lefts and a right. I can do this.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.220
Two lefts and a right. Okay.
Don't forget.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.100
(GASPING)

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.540
(GRUNTS)

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.180
Two lefts and a right.
Two lefts and a right.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.060
Two lefts and a right. Two lefts
and a right. Two lefts and a right.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.900
Two lefts and a right? Shoot.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.020
Left and a right. Wait.
Did I already take a left?

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:43.540
Oh no. It's happening. Okay, hold on.
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:47.580
Which way? Where am I going?
I can't remember. Okay.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.340
Okay. I'm lost. It's too hard.
I can't remember.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.580
I'm forgetting everything.

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.580
I'm gonna be stuck forever in the pipes.
The pipes! The pipe pals.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.260
Pipe pals? Pipe pals!

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.980
-And...swim, swim, swim.
-Yeah, I don't know about this.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.500
Trust me,
I won't let you hit anything. Wall!

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.620
(DESTINY GROANS)

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.660
What's the point?
I'll never learn to get around!

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.460
You better! If you can't do it in here
you'll never do it out in the ocean.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.820
Now really focus, okay? Wall!

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.460
-DORY: Destiny!
-(GASPS)

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.460
Dory? (VOCALIZING) Hello?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:19.300
(VOCALIZING) I'm lost in the pipes
and my parents are in quarantine!

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.820
Hang on, Dory! Bailey!
You've got to use your echolocation!

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:23.820
You know it's broken!

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.460
Just stop it, and try the "Ooh" thing
Dory talked about, will you?

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.620
-But I don't think I can--
-Don't bail on me, Bailey!

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.660
Ooh!

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.140
Ooh! Ooh!

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.300
Come on, Bailey. What did you
just tell me, huh? Really focus!

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.860
Ooh! I feel stupid.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:42.140
-Bailey.
-Sorry. Ooh!

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.780
-DORY: Hello?
-Here!

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.820
(VOCALIZING) We're here!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.580
-Guys-- Ooh! Guys-- Ooh!
-What? What is it?

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.900
I'm getting something! Ooh!
Here we go! Ooh! Oh yes! Ooh!

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.660
I can see the quarantine!
(LAUGHS) This is amazing!

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:02.740
Ooh! I can see everything!
And I can see you!

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.620
(VOCALIZING) He can see you!

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.700
My life's a rainbow! Can you see me?

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.860
(LAUGHS) Right,
it doesn't work that way.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.140
-Bailey!
-Okay! Tell Dory to go left!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.700
(VOCALIZING) He says go left!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.260
(VOCALIZING) Left?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.340
(PANTING)

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.100
-Ooh! Straight!
-Straight!

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.020
-Straight!
-Ooh! Go right!

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.860
-Right!
-Right!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.700
Ooh! I'm light-headed! Ooh! Wait. Ooh!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:28.180
I'm picking up something else.
Hold on! Let me zoom out.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.940
BAILEY: Zzz... (GASPS)

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.140
Holy Neptune, she's not alone! Ooh!

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.300
-What is it?
-I can't tell! But it's coming for her.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.020
Oh no! (VOCALIZING) Dory, swim!
Swim the other way!

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.620
-What? Where?
-What? Where?

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.260
-Go right!
-Right!

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.180
(GASPING)

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.700
No, my right!
Oh no! She's heading right towards it!

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.700
No! Dory, turn around!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:52.020
That's great, Dory!
You're headed right toward us!

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.860
What? You want me to go right?

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.460
No! No! Not right. Oh, I can't look!

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.540
(PANTING)

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.220
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.220
-BOTH: Dory!
-Marlin?

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.700
-I knew it! You're okay!
-Oh my gosh!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.700
BAILEY: It's consuming her!
It's eating her alive!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.300
(BOTH CRYING)

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:10.900
-You're okay!
-You found me! How did you find me?

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.220
There was a crazy clam.
He wouldn't stop talking.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.580
We just slowly backed away from him
and into these pipes.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.220
And then we just started looking.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.060
DESTINY: Dory! I'm sorry!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.740
Okay, what was that?

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.220
Hang on. I got to take this.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.100
It's okay! Sorry for what?

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.220
What? You're okay?

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:30.900
-Yes!
-DORY: I found Marlin and Nemo!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:31.980
(LAUGHS)

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.780
Dad! Did you hear that?
Dory really does speak whale.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.020
I heard.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.700
It's bringing back some very bad
memories so let's get out of here.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:42.700
I say we go this way.
Follow me. It's time to head home!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.660
Wait, wait, wait! Um...
My parents are here.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.580
-They are?
-You found your parents?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:53.100
Well, not exactly. No. I mean not yet,
but, um, I know where they are.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:57.540
I don't know exactly how to get there,
but I know that-- I'm getting help--

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.420
-DESTINY: Down to quarantine.
-Quarantine.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:03.260
That's it! Oh, and I met
this septopus, super cranky...

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:08.460
but secretly kind of sweet, and he
got me into the exhibit... The exhibit.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:11.940
Dory?

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.940
Do you think my parents
will want to see me?

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.460
What? Why wouldn't they
want to see you?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.460
Because... I lost them?

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:26.420
Dory, your parents are going to be
overjoyed to see you.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.300
They're going to have missed...
everything about you.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.820
-Really?
-Do you know how we found you?

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.820
-Something about a clam? Or...
-No.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:35.820
-No, an oyster.
-No.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.020
-Mollusk?
-No.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:37.860
-Something?
-No.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.260
-I don't... No?
-No clam.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.140
We were having a very hard time
until Nemo thought...

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.300
"What would Dory do?"

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.140
Why would you say that?

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.300
Because ever since I've met you,
you've shown me how to do...

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.700
stuff I never dreamed of doing.
Crazy things!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.020
Outsmarting sharks
and jumping jellyfish.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:03.500
And finding my son.
You made all that happen.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:09.540
Really? I didn't know you thought that.
Unless I forgot.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:14.020
No, you didn't forget. I never told you.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.020
And I'm sorry about that.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:25.140
But, Dory, because of who you are,
you are about to find your parents.

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:32.700
And when you do that, you'll be home.

